'''Shadow Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BJCP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 809
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Shadow Cat
|name2 = Shadow Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shadow Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is a Metal meatshield comparable to the likes of [[Rope Jump Cat (Rare Cat)|Noodle Cats]] and [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]]. However, Shadow Cat has the potential to outperform both of them in certain situations thanks to its status as a gacha unit with access to +Levels—it only needs to Lv.50+8 to surpass even a maxed out Future Cat. Despite its high cost, Shadow Cat has the stats and speed necessary to function as a supplemental meatshield, used alongside [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] and Modern Cat. It is worth noting that this unit's recharge time is quite long; just like Future Cat, the use of [[Cat Combo]]s is recommended to make it a more reliable meatshield. Once Future Cat is obtained, she tends to over''shadow'' this unit's performance thanks to her [[Insanely Tough]] ability and far lower cost.

Regardless, Shadow Cat remains as a valuable option for certain restriction stages as well as the [[Underground Labyrinth]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

